  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Memorial Sensory Garden for Salama Primary School</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On October 25th, 2022 11 girls (ages 7-10 yrs) were killed in a dormitory fire at Uganda&apos;s Salama Primary School for the Blind. The first priority for funds will be purchasing fire extinguishers to prevent this tragedy from ever happening again. Next, a memorial garden including name plaques, fragrant/soft plants, seating, and musical features will be created to foster community healing. Once this project is fully funded we will install a large rain tank for safety, hygiene, and hydration needs.</narrative>
  </description>
